WEBVTT

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.230
Jij hebt alle beslissingen genomen.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.350
Psychologen, zoek het maar uit.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.000
Kijk maar even.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.000
SJ: Oh!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.000
(Applaus)

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.000
KB: Dank je.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.700
(Applaus)

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:15.720
Dank je.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.770
Als iemand straks
wat vingervlugheid wil zien,

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:23.000
ik ben buiten.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.000
Dank je.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.000
(Applaus)

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.370
(Dank je)

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.000
(Dank je)

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.690
(Applaus)